.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH impulse-graph 1  "impulse-graph 2.4.0" 
.SH NAME
impulse\-graph \- Impulse Graph Engine Developer Utilities & Layout Optimizer Suite (Spec v2.4)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBimpulse\-graph\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Official CLI utility for inspecting, validating, compiling, optimizing, signing, comparing, and exporting zero\-copy Impulse Graph binary snapshot files (.imps).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
impulse\-graph\-inspect(1)
Inspect binary snapshot header, section directory, domain catalogs, and topology metadata
.TP
impulse\-graph\-validate(1)
Validate binary snapshot file against Spec v2.4 normative requirements
.TP
impulse\-graph\-compile(1)
Compile edge list CSV/TSV/JSON\-L data into zero\-copy binary snapshot (.imps)
.TP
impulse\-graph\-optimize(1)
Heavy offline snapshot layout optimizer (RCM graph reordering, vector encodings, section stripping)
.TP
impulse\-graph\-keygen(1)
Generate Ed25519 keypairs for snapshot signature verification
.TP
impulse\-graph\-sign(1)
Sign a binary snapshot using Ed25519 private key
.TP
impulse\-graph\-verify(1)
Verify Ed25519 signature on a binary snapshot
.TP
impulse\-graph\-diff(1)
Compare structural topology and schema differences between two binary snapshots
.TP
impulse\-graph\-export(1)
Export binary snapshot file (.imps) back to CSV/TSV edge lists
.TP
impulse\-graph\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v2.4.0
.SH AUTHORS
Impulse Graph Engine Contributors
